ing\n509:### 7.2 Portable numeric & collection contract (`clj.py` over `:pure` host core + `yrt.effect`)\n530:### 7.3 Python lowering Hook ABI & `clj.py` adapters\n549:### 7.4 Unified trusted `clj` callable bridge, cross-unit admission, and §8.10.7 validation\n564:### 7.5 Two-module portable `clojure.core` contract (`clojure.core.impl` + `clojure.core`)\n584:### 7.6 Concrete lowering example\n602:## 8. Portability, content addressing, and malleability\n604:### 8.1 Multi-host portability (JVM, CLJS/Node, CLJD/Dart, Jolt/Scheme)\n611:### 8.2 Dependency graph and malleability (`docs/agents/malleability.md`)\n629:### 8.3 Content-addressing and golden discipline (Clean-Slate)\n635:## 9. Phased implementation roadmap and acceptance gates\n650:## 10. Owner decisions and disposition ledger\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
